# NEVER SHIP A KEY FILE. Cloud Run supplies the credential through the metadata
# server, so `init_app` needs no key at all — a key only exists on a developer's
# machine for local runs, and baking one into a layer publishes it to anybody who
# can pull the image.
*.json
